      "commarea": null,
      "terminal": "ECS1 GET ",
      "why": "#6072: the operator types 2009 bytes; ECS001's RECEIVE INTO(TERM-DATA) takes at most TERM-DATA-LEN = 1920 (24 lines of 80), so the region answers LENGERR (IBM: the data is longer than the area, RECEIVE is truncated), the IF at line 106 (NORMAL or 6) is false and A1000 reports 'A1000: RECEIVE ERROR:' with RESP and RESP2 through Z1000-EXIT-PROGRAM, before any WEB command"
